==Acquisition==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page three of the [[Steeled Veterans Premium Warbond#Page 3|Steeled Veterans]] Premium [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|64|notext}} and 48 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

